{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211460","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1121146001:1":{"text":"……大家停步！","source_cn":"……大家停步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38B56E9B48FE18D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121146002:1":{"text":"这股气息……是恶魔。就在这附近！","source_cn":"这股气息……是恶魔。就在这附近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA128DDDFAB157AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121146003:1":{"text":"什么，恶魔？！在哪里！？满满要保护大家！","source_cn":"什么，恶魔？！在哪里！？满满要保护大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AA48C9775BC0ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121146004:1":{"text":"气息在远离我们，速度很快……不能让他逃走。","source_cn":"气息在远离我们，速度很快……不能让他逃走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E9570B3964376C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121146005:1":{"text":"太危险了，你们不要跟来，我去追上他！","source_cn":"太危险了，你们不要跟来，我去追上他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED639C41D34D7C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121146006:1":{"text":"诶，塔琳小姐——！等等呀！","source_cn":"诶，塔琳小姐——！等等呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410AC632E592EEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:11:1121147001:":{"text":"恶魔，别想逃！","source_cn":"恶魔，别想逃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33934A99175D803D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121146007:1":{"text":"哇，她振翅飞走了……","source_cn":"哇，她振翅飞走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C6B8C2C677D8250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121146008:1":{"text":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CEAC8C212D5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1121146008":{"text":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，刚才那位陌生的女士，是不是提到了——恶魔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CEAC8C212D5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121146009:2":{"text":"原来如此，失忆的半神与身份不明的恶魔，还有神秘增加的神像。","source_cn":"原来如此，失忆的半神与身份不明的恶魔，还有神秘增加的神像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441B319FA5348C98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121146010:1":{"text":"感谢诸位愿意前来。同样的事情正在发生。","source_cn":"感谢诸位愿意前来。同样的事情正在发生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF439C3796D350C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121146011:1":{"text":"什——什么？同样的事情？","source_cn":"什——什么？同样的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1523806170311245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121146012:1":{"text":"难道鹿灵雕像也变成了两个？！","source_cn":"难道鹿灵雕像也变成了两个？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D5340CCC1E509A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121146013:1":{"text":"略有不同。","source_cn":"略有不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A897C86658CF9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121146014:3":{"text":"那么，诸位是要直接前往鹿灵圣丘，或是在这里等待塔琳女士回归？","source_cn":"那么，诸位是要直接前往鹿灵圣丘，或是在这里等待塔琳女士回归？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE279CF7D091AC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: